  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "6:44 P.M.    天气/晴\n龙门绕城公路，车内"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爷，您睡着了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "唔，抱歉......我们到哪儿了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "就快到约定的碰头地点了，请打起精神来，少爷。企鹅物流的诸位已经在等着了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "嗯，我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "您看上去很疲惫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "没有的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "请原谅我多嘴，但老爷这次的决定实在是有些仓促，如果少爷有什么难处，请务必开口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......父亲，一定有他自己的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "而且，只要能在企鹅物流有所作为，父亲身边的那些人，说不定就不会再阻拦我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爷是家族有史以来最年轻的信使，您的工作能力无可挑剔，这就足够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "也许吧，但是，那些大人们未必会这么想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "看看窗外，现在龙门大半的民营信使业务已经落到了父亲的手里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "企鹅物流，他们是最后的，也是最独立的，奇怪传闻最多的公司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "虽然父亲和大帝先生的关系好像很好，可我们必须了解他们，至少我得这么做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "所以我才会担心少爷，企鹅物流太过于特殊了，我很清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "你不用总摆出这么一副表情。我可以自己处理好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "您也是，少爷。多像同龄人一样笑一笑吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "今晚是安魂夜，您本可以和朋友们一起去街上逛逛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......你是在嘲笑我没朋友吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "岂敢，岂敢，哈哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "抱歉，少爷，您的盾还在手边吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "怎么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "我们被盯上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "发现目标，准备好了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "呃，引爆组的导火索似乎有点短......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "那不是问题，动手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "唔——爆炸！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爷，抓稳了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "发现目标，还活着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "把他带走，动作快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（居然炸毁了公路.....？到底，是谁......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（该死，视野......看不清......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "情况怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "目击者很多，但没有看见其他目标人员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "等等，烟雾里还有其他人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "还有幸存者？那就一起——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "唔呃——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "喂？喂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "这么简单就被干掉了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "嘁，我可不喜欢这么老套的电影戏码。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "企鹅物流。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哟，看来你很清楚嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "不过在我看来，在边郊公路中央设置路障再埋下炸弹，这手法也是相当复古哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "爆破只是个人爱好，环顾一下你的周围，事情没这么简单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "该死，那个蠢货竟然用了这么多源石炸药，如果让鼠王知道了，我们吃不了兜着走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "发现企鹅物流的信使，是能天使。她把爆破组的人都给......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "我不瞎，没所谓。那只叫德克萨斯的狼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "不，没有看见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "哼。那就算了，包围他们，速战速决。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "果然还有埋伏，做得挺彻底嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "喂，你还能动吗？手脚都摇摇晃晃的哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......勉强吧，你就是......能天使小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "嗯！你是叫，呃，什么来着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "拜松。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "我们......我们得先离开这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "不要绷着一张脸，那位老管家平安无事哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "真的吗！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "姑且有把他送到路边，不过看他的样子其实不太需要帮忙......但是算啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "企鹅物流的能天使，还有这位小少爷，投降吧，跟我们走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "不少生面孔呢，都是你在叙拉古的亲戚？有没有提醒他们在龙门抢生意的注意事项？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "这不关你事，这一次，我们会把你们彻底击溃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "嗯......在龙门呆了这么多年，你们抢地盘的方式倒是最简单粗暴的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "看来叙拉古的黑手党也不是只有在酒吧挨揍的份嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "啊啊......你会后悔小看西西里人的，*龙门粗口*，动手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "哎呀，我这算勉强赶上？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "时机完美，可颂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "可他们好像不打算收手哎，接下来怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "老规矩，你开路，我殿后，完事儿奖金对半分~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "那我就——不客气了啊啊啊啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "那，那个怪力疯子直接撞开了一条路！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "......你们先追，不要跟太紧，等首领的支援。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "是、是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "你把他们放跑了，废物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "嘁，绑票本来就不是我的长项。企鹅物流其他成员没有出现，部署完成之前，贸然进入龙门市区对我们不利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "随便你找借口，有一辆车向你那儿去了。开着敞篷，可都是熟到发焦的老熟人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "......这么快？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "啊，不好，这是第几个死胡同了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "反正周围都是些几百年没人管的烂尾楼，不如直接在墙上开个洞呗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "等、等等，两位！我们到底要去哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "他们在这儿！居然钻到死胡同里等死，包围他们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "我们这不是无路可退了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "对了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "有什么对策！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "我们还没正式打过招呼吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "把他们全部干掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "现在不是说这个的时候吧！这很重要吗！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "这很重要，非常重要，相当重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我们可是非常注重塑造企业文化的，而今天的文化关键词恰好是“仪式感”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "虽然是刚刚决定的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "是、是大帝！快通知首领！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "等等，后面还有一个！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "饵撒空了，能天使。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "叙拉古的家伙们也不全是傻瓜嘛，下次还有机会，别介意别介意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "比起这个，给你们介绍一下，这位就是咱们企鹅物流的临时成员，拜松。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "那家伙堵住了退路，只、只能动手了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "都躺下，轮不到你们送死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "嘁！不要慌，只要拖到首领的支援——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "拖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "开灯，啊哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "好、好闪！哪儿来的聚光灯！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "欢迎来到企鹅物流，小猫小狗们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
